  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd241129e0dfdacc797f68-fb9fae5a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd241129e0dfdacc797f68-f98b56b8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fish is cooking, in a large bowl, combine slaw mix, half the BBQ Mayo and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Season, then toss to coat.\n• Heat mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in the microwave in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd241129e0dfdacc797f68-b5d512ab.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Spread remaining BBQ mayo over tortillas.\n• Top each tortilla with slaw, cucumber and plant-based crumbed chicken to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd241129e0dfdacc797f68-745ca3ca.jpeg"
    }
  ]
